true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2114b7d641739c3e\" href=\"?note=2114b7d641739c3e\" title=\"43-df-effhausdim\">43-df-effhausdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28c411f76cbe3176\" href=\"?note=28c411f76cbe3176\" title=\"43-df-effpackdim\">43-df-effpackdim</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dc081d5f47bf786e\" href=\"?note=dc081d5f47bf786e\" title=\"43-thm-kolm-upper\">43-thm-kolm-upper</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\le\\dim_H(X)\\le\\mathrm{Dim}(X)\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\le\\dim_H(X)\\le\\mathrm{Dim}(X)\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：非负性与 liminf≤limsup；通用上界 K(σ)≤|σ|+K(|σ|)+O(1) 且 K(n)=O(log n) 给上界1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effhausdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effpackdim","status":"resolved","id":"28c411f76cbe3176","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effpackdim]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-kolm-upper","status":"resolved","id":"dc081d5f47bf786e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-kolm-upper]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effhausdim","status":"resolved","id":"2114b7d641739c3e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\